Orbit Space
===========

This project is built on NewBlackbox (https://github.com/ALEX5402/NewBlackbox,
commit 89b59836c66f173756a4ae258cf379a957649820), which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 and is itself derived from BlackBox and VirtualApp.
The full license text is in the LICENSE file.

The Bcore, black-reflection and compiler directories are the upstream engine.
The app directory (the launcher) is new.

Changes made to the upstream engine
-----------------------------------
- app/configuration/ClientConfiguration.java: getLogSenderChatId() now returns
  null, which disables the upload of logcat and device details to a third-party
  server on crashes. Added isEnableLogcatCapture(), default false.
- BlackBoxCore.java: continuous logcat capture to Downloads/logs now only starts
  when isEnableLogcatCapture() returns true.
- closecode/Entry.java removed (a hook that loaded an external native library
  into a guest app).
- cpp/Utils/VirtualSpoof.cpp removed (reported a fake device model and Android
  version to guest apps). cpp/Utils/AntiDetection.cpp removed. cpp/Android.mk
  updated to match.
- Bcore/build.gradle: code shrinking turned off for release builds.
- The upstream demo app, its bundled third-party libraries, the upstream CI
  workflow and the upstream documentation were not carried over.
